  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>;</mo></math>&nbsp;<math><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8804;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br />The desired number is the coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></math> in<br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />or the coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></math> in <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />or the coefficient of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></math> in <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi></mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi></mi></math> coefficient of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></math> in <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mo>=</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mo>&#215;</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>-